{
  "name": "Auto Insurance Claim Approval System (AI + PDF API Hub) -happy path",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🏥 Auto Insurance Claim Approval System\n\n**What this workflow does:**\n1. Watches a Google Drive folder for new claim PDFs\n2. Downloads and extracts text from the claim form (PDF API Hub – Parse PDF)\n3. Sends the extracted data to OpenAI for automated claim evaluation\n4. Routes the claim to one of three paths:\n   - ✅ **Approved** → generates approval letter PDF, signs it, adds APPROVED watermark, uploads to Drive, emails claimant\n   - ❌ **Rejected** → generates rejection letter PDF, adds REJECTED watermark, uploads to Drive, emails claimant\n   - 🔍 **Manual Review** → forwards to a claims adjuster for human review\n5. Every claim is logged to a Google Sheet for tracking\n\n**Google Sheet Setup:**\nCreate a sheet with a tab named `claims` and these headers in row 1:\n\n| claim_id | claimant_name | claimant_email | claim_type | decision | approved_amount | reasoning | risk_flags | processed_at |\n\n**Credentials needed:**\n- Google Drive OAuth2\n- Google Sheets OAuth2\n- Gmail OAuth2\n- OpenAI API key\n- PDF API Hub API key (get one at pdfapihub.com)\n\n**PDF API Hub nodes used:**\n- Parse PDF (extract claim text)\n- HTML to PDF (generate letters) ×2\n- Sign PDF (authorized signature)\n- Add Watermark (APPROVED / REJECTED stamps) ×2\n\n**Customization tips:**\n- Edit the AI prompt in \"AI Claim Evaluator\" to match your underwriting rules\n- Edit HTML in the letter-generation nodes to match your branding\n- Change the signature URL in \"Sign Approval Letter\" to your authorized signatory",
        "height": 812,
        "width": 740,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "2706d59d-83b1-43b0-a2f8-d86f0c93eba6",
